      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1715127670,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 1706550954,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780573993064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当断面空间压缩后，车道宽度缩减或侧向净空不足，导致车辆横向偏移量显著增大。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当断面空间压缩后，车道宽度缩减或侧向净空不足，导致车辆横向偏移量显著增大。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
