      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "f93wsJ3rSNgoj7lW-jJEk",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1780622747671,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "路基施工、路面一期：冲突数随交通量增大单调递增，且增速逐渐加快；车流密度升高、车\n头时距缩减，加之路况压缩引发变道、超车行为增多，冲突持续加剧。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "路基施工、路面一期：冲突数随交通量增大单调递增，且增速逐渐加快；车流密度升高、车头时距缩减，加之路况压缩引发变道、超车行为增多，冲突持续加剧。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "vrM2BBDapuHHhzOw59XHe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1581.411035051816,
      "y": 1346.8226574853336,
      "width": 705.46875,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 115411000,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 76035640,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780576117155,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "路面施工二期：存在阈值效应，交通量＜850pcu/h 时冲突数随流量递增；达到\n850pcu/h 后道路趋于饱和，车辆无法自由变道超车，冲突数回落并趋于稳定。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "路面施工二期：存在阈值效应，交通量＜850pcu/h 时冲突数随流量递增；达到 850pcu/h 后道路趋于饱和，车辆无法自由变道超车，冲突数回落并趋于稳定。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "-UbXiKHoSFyG4BhW7VMKS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1884.145410051816,
      "y": 1416.8226574853336,
      "width": 100,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 431798088,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 1402253112,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780576117155,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "②大车比例",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "②大车比例",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "3ufQjVuqTlqE4WwnCckyM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1532.145410051816,
      "y": 1449.8226574853336,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 72,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1996702008,
      "version": 42,
      "versionNonce": 1970390182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780621463230,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "各阶段均呈显著正相关；大小车动力性能、行驶速度差异显著，施工占道后混道行驶，大车\n占用道路空间大、合流干扰强，是诱发冲突的主导因素；路面一期大车比例＞0.23 后冲突\n增速明显加快。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "各阶段均呈显著正相关；大小车动力性能、行驶速度差异显著，施工占道后混道行驶，大车占用道路空间大、合流干扰强，是诱发冲突的主导因素；路面一期大车比例＞0.23 后冲突增速明显加快。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "Lv3gYrFD0i16hwmAjcxcq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1884.145410051816,
      "y": 1532.8226574853336,
      "width": 100,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1589022280,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 732709176,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780576117155,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "③平均车速",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "③平均车速",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "TlZ8GLG8SEvao0YhGS8y5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1534.145410051816,
      "y": 1554.8226574853336,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2021022264,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 805263928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780576117155,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "平均行驶车速越大，车辆驶入施工区减速幅度与速度差越大，前后车速度离散性增强，直接\n加剧跟车、加减速类交通冲突。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "平均行驶车速越大，车辆驶入施工区减速幅度与速度差越大，前后车速度离散性增强，直接加剧跟车、加减速类交通冲突。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "HQ9YItgl38jFfUgtA-0aV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1884.145410051816,
      "y": 1624.8226574853336,
      "width": 100,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 878544200,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 1283937080,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780576117155,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "④车道宽度",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "④车道宽度",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "M5LWUeL6cpby9zSCdkbzK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1535.145410051816,
      "y": 1676.8226574853336,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1847481144,
      "version": 35,
      "versionNonce": 716935206,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780621464414,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "车道封闭压缩宽度越大，有效通行空间越小，车辆横向避让、占道行驶干扰加剧，冲突数量\n呈加速增长趋势，道路封闭对行车干扰逐级放大。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "车道封闭压缩宽度越大，有效通行空间越小，车辆横向避让、占道行驶干扰加剧，冲突数量呈加速增长趋势，道路封闭对行车干扰逐级放大。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
