      "updated": 1780622723018,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "二变一",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "XFvrH9fENfLuot9qFd1zC",
      "originalText": "二变一",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "u91X1nwg8yHHo0b-5cdLJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1490.2168386232458,
      "y": 2349.8048003424765,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1302256614,
      "version": 11,
      "versionNonce": 855510266,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780622716742,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "而是大量车辆必须在短距离内并入同一车道。并道越困难，车距越小，强制换道越多，交通\n流就越不稳定，也越容易形成拥堵和事故风险。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "而是大量车辆必须在短距离内并入同一车道。并道越困难，车距越小，强制换道越多，交通流就越不稳定，也越容易形成拥堵和事故风险。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "5lAKhd7wVsGTXlKbPrXrD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2553.0739814803887,
      "y": 2327.66194319962,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1876551142,
      "version": 48,
      "versionNonce": 305086950,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780622731069,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "中央分隔带开口长度、开口位置、开口间距、过渡段长度、转换区运行速度、车头时距和换\n道频率，是评价交通转换安全和通行稳定性的关键指标。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "中央分隔带开口长度、开口位置、开口间距、过渡段长度、转换区运行速度、车头时距和换道频率，是评价交通转换安全和通行稳定性的关键指标。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
